== Installation

This plugin extends `tracrpc.api.XmlRpcSystem` by implementing `tracrpc.api.IRPCProtocol`, and therefore requires at least version `1.1.0` (or higher) of XmlRpcPlugin .

SInce version 2.0.0 only Python 3 is supported.

General instructions on installing Trac plugins can be found on the [https://trac-hacks.org/wiki/TracPlugins#InstallingaTracplugin TracPlugins] page.

